{
  "answerFirst": "<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">在浏览各类 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">机场排行</strong> 榜单时，用户必须警惕纯商业佣金排名的误导。\n真正的天梯排名必须建立在严谨的 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">晚高峰压测数据</strong>、<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">物理专线架构真实性</strong> 与 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">长期运营存活率</strong> 之上。</p>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">2026 商业机场综合天梯总榜速览</strong>：</p>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">S 级王者梯队（综合 95+ 分）</strong>：<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">光速云 (Guangsu)</strong>。标配 IEPL 企业纯内网双专线，晚高峰 4K/8K 秒开吞吐突破 82,000 Kbps，三网丢包率 0%，原生住宅 IP 流媒体与 AI 全绿解锁；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">A 级优秀梯队（综合 85-94 分）</strong>：<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">暮光加速 (Muguang)</strong>、<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">肥猫云 (Feimao)</strong>。分别在大带宽流媒体追剧与平民高性价比领域表现卓越；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">B 级主流梯队（综合 75-84 分）</strong>：<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">威风云 (Weifeng)</strong>、<strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">极连云 (Jilian)</strong>。适合轻量级文献查阅与作为二线容灾备用；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">C 级警示梯队（不予上榜）</strong>：充斥“1元 1000G”、公网劣质直连、暗藏 10x 扣费与虚假节点的短期跑路盘。</li>\n</ol>\n",
  "table1": "<div class=\"table-responsive-wrapper overflow-x-auto my-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm\" style=\"overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm border-collapse\" style=\"min-width: 680px;\">\n<thead class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">天梯梯队</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">服务商品牌</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">综合得分</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">核心线路架构</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">晚高峰下行吞吐</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">延迟中位数 (深港/沪日)</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">丢包率 (晚高峰实测)</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">流媒体解锁表现</th>\n<th class=\"p-3.5 font-bold border-b border-slate-200 whitespace-nowrap text-xs sm:text-sm\">综合推荐定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">S 级 (旗舰王者)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">光速云</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">98.5 分</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">IEPL 企业纯内网双专线</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">85,400+ Kbps</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">18ms / 28ms</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">0.0% (零丢包)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">原生住宅 IP 全绿</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">全场景天梯首选标杆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">A+ 级 (影音先锋)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">暮光加速</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">92.0 分</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">IEPL 专线中转</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">76,200+ Kbps</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">22ms / 32ms</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">0.2% (极轻微)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">Netflix/Disney+ 全解锁</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">大码率 4K/8K 追剧发烧友</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">A 级 (平民黑马)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">肥猫云</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">88.5 分</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">BGP 优质公网隧道</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">58,500+ Kbps</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">35ms / 48ms</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">0.8% (轻微抖动)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">主流流媒体支持</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">学生党与平民出海性价比首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">B+ 级 (稳健备用)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">威风云</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">83.0 分</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">BGP 隧道多线</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">51,200+ Kbps</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">38ms / 52ms</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">1.5% (偶发抖动)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">部分节点支持 ChatGPT</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">稳定备用容灾与轻办公</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">B 级 (平民入门)</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">极连云</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">76.0 分</strong></td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">公网单线直连/中转</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">36,000+ Kbps</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">45ms / 65ms</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">3.8% (高峰丢包)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">基础自制剧解锁</td>\n<td class=\"p-3.5 border-b border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed\">极低预算极客与尝鲜体验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n",
  "chap1": "<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">1. 机场排行榜五维量化评分模型与权重分配</h3>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">为了杜绝主观臆断，v2rayn指南测评实验室制定了严谨的百分制加权评估公式：</p>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">$$综合得分 = 专线物理质量(35%) + 晚高峰吞吐带宽(25%) + IP信誉与解锁率(15%) + 计费透明度(15%) + 售后与存活周期(10%)$$</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">专线物理质量（权重 35%）</strong>：\n核心考核服务商是否具备电信级 IEPL/IPLC 物理内网专线。专线不过公网 GFW 国际出口，敏感期可用率是否达到 99.8% 以上；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">晚高峰单线程吞吐（权重 25%）</strong>：\n重点采集 20:00-23:00 骨干网最高峰期的持续下载速率，严禁使用多线程虚假测速，以 YouTube 4K/8K 真实播放缓冲速度为准；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">IP 纯净度与解锁率（权重 15%）</strong>：\n对 Netflix（非自制剧）、Disney+、HBO Max、ChatGPT、Claude 3.5 的节点解锁覆盖率，以及 IP 欺诈度风险分值（Fraud Score）；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">资费模型与计费透明度（权重 15%）</strong>：\n是否存在隐性倍率偷扣流量、是否支持小额月付、套餐单 G 专线价格是否合理透明；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">历史存活与工单 SLA（权重 10%）</strong>：\n连续稳定运营月数、重大故障公告透明度、工单平均修复响应时效。</li>\n</ul>\n",
  "chap2": "<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">2. S 级与 A 级天梯品牌深度评测实录</h3>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">S 级标杆：光速云（Guangsu Cloud）实测报告</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">实测网络拓扑</strong>：沪日、广港两套物理冗余专线通道，境内接入点配备三网 BGP 动态路由解析；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">电信/联通/移动三网实测</strong>：\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li>上海电信千兆宽带：连接香港 01 专线节点，YouTube 连接速度达 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">86,200 Kbps</strong>，4K 视频加载耗时仅 0.4 秒；</li>\n<li>广州移动千兆宽带：连接深圳入口专线，端到端延迟低至 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">14ms</strong>，往返抖动仅 1.2ms；</li>\n<li>北京联通 500M 宽带：连接京德/沪日专线，晚高峰丢包率持续保持 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">0%</strong>；</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">综合评定</strong>：在架构韧性、带宽储备和节点透明度方面处于行业绝对领跑地位，当之无愧位列 2026 综合排行榜榜首。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">A 级梯队：暮光加速与肥猫云的定位拆解</h4>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">暮光加速</strong>：在美西与亚太大带宽节点上投入巨大，晚高峰持续吞吐能力强悍，但月付门槛稍高，适合预算充裕的影视发烧友；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">肥猫云</strong>：在 10-15 元/月价位段表现抢眼，BGP 隧道转发成熟，在保证基本网页与学术浏览的前提下，将单位流量成本压缩到了极致。</li>\n</ul>\n",
  "chap3": "<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">3. 揭秘测速假象：为什么你看到的“彩虹测速图”不可信？</h3>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">社交平台与测速频道上广泛流传的花花绿绿“全绿彩虹图”往往具有巨大的欺骗性：</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">1. 多线程瞬间并发 vs 单线程持续吞吐</h4>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">测速脚本（如 SSRSpeed）通常会开启 8 到 16 个并发 TCP 线程向测速服务器打满数据。这种多线程并发能掩盖高丢包带来的危害，跑出几百兆的虚假数字。然而在实际浏览网页、看 YouTube 或进行跨国 Zoom 会议时，单条连接的丢包会导致 TCP 窗口断崖式收缩，几百兆的测速瞬间沦为卡顿断流。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">2. 空载非高峰期测速假象</h4>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">许多评测人员在凌晨 3 点网络空载时进行测速，此时公网国际出口几乎没有压力，任何垃圾直连节点都能跑出好看的数据。一旦进入晚间 20:00 黄金高峰期，公网国际关口局丢包率飙升至 30% 以上，空载测试数据完全失去参考价值。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">3. 测速服务器被商家加入白名单或本地缓存</h4>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">部分不诚信的小作坊机场会在中转机房劫持测速域名（如 speedtest.net），将其重定向到本地内网缓存节点，制造出数千兆假测速假象，实际访问外网依然如龟速。</p>\n",
  "chap4": "<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">4. 如何在本地进行科学客观的链路质量验收？</h3>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">作为普通用户，收到机场订阅后，可通过以下三步验证其在天梯中的真实档位：</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">第一步：真连接延迟（URL Test）与抖动测试</h4>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">在 Clash Verge Rev 中点击节点列表右下角的「Wi-Fi 图标」（连通性测试）。</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">优秀标准</strong>：延迟测试返回真实数字（如香港 15-35ms，日本 40-60ms），连续测试 5 次，数字波动不超过 5ms；</li>\n<li><strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">垃圾特征</strong>：偶尔返回 20ms，下一次瞬间变红（Timeout），说明线路极其不稳定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">第二步：YouTube 详细统计信息实测</h4>\n<ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li>连接机场香港或日本优质节点；</li>\n<li>打开 YouTube 任意一段 4K@60fps 或 8K 官方超高清视频；</li>\n<li>右键点击画面，选择「详细统计信息 (Stats for nerds)」；</li>\n<li>观察 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">Connection Speed</strong> 数值：\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li>超过 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">60,000 Kbps</strong>：属于 S 级或 A 级专线；</li>\n<li>介于 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">20,000 - 50,000 Kbps</strong>：属于 B 级主流中转；</li>\n<li>低于 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">10,000 Kbps</strong> 且 Buffer Health 持续探底：属于不入流的垃圾线路。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-5 mb-2\">第三步：流媒体与 IP 欺诈度核验</h4>\n<p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">访问 <code class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 text-brand-600 font-mono text-xs break-all\">ipinfo.io</code> 或 <code class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 text-brand-600 font-mono text-xs break-all\">scamalytics.com</code>，检查出口 IP 的 <strong class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">Fraud Score</strong>（欺诈评分）：</p>\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 my-4 pl-2\">\n<li>评分 &lt; 15 分且标记为 ISP / Residential：代表极度纯净，可放心用于 ChatGPT 与网银；</li>\n<li>评分 &gt; 50 分且标记为 Data Center / Hosting：代表被各大平台列入黑名单，随时可能触发验证码或封号。</li>\n</ul>\n",
